Translated out of view rather than `display: none` or `visibility: hidden`, both of which remove it from the tab order entirely and defeat the purpose. `z-index: 100` clears the nav (`z-index: 50`) and stays well under `Grain`.

Activating it moves focus to `<main>` — `href="#main"` plus `tabIndex={-1}` on the target is what makes the focus actually move rather than only scrolling, which is the common broken implementation.

